        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk6-concession-frames-p03-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "不 / 这: 这也不X那也不Y rejects both options",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "这也不X那也不Y criticizes rejection of both alternatives. It describes unwillingness or dissatisfaction rather than a balanced choice.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这也不吃，那也不吃。",
                "pinyin": "zhè yě bù chī ， nà yě bù chī 。",
                "meaning": "You refuse to eat this or that.",
                "audio": "eefdd462f4be4cc9a82714c87d5481d4e88b3d240c61bb96bdad3df1c6e16ebf"
              },
              {
                "text": "这也不好，那也不好。",
                "pinyin": "zhè yě bù hǎo ， nà yě bù hǎo 。",
                "meaning": "You find fault with this and that alike.",
                "audio": "439698ab67cecfb359afc5cc6547ad27c327b2caacb54d5d86089eb67f3fb7f2"
              }
            ]
          },
